    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. vulnerability assessment for 4 priority sectors prepared. 
2. capacity assessment for relevant institutions prepared
3. capacity building program designed 
4. Finalise the design of the ToR for training for IHSM staff Initiate the training for the IHSM 
5. support to the National Council of Sustainable Development working group of CCA provided</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. final draft of vulnerability assessments for 4 priority sectors prepared. 
2. final draft of capacity assessment for relevant institutions prepared
3. first draft capacity building program designed 
4. not finalised under the NAP, moved for 2023. The parallel UNDP project organised training for IHSM staff, the NAP intervention postponed as a follow up of this initiative. 
5. National Council of Sustainable Development working group of CCA formed</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">ProDoc signing and project start up
Inception period and Work plan developement and implementation
Initial hiring of consultants implemented. The initial set of experts will focus on: 
- vulnerability assessment for 4 priority sectors
- capacity assessment for relevant institutions 
- support to the National Council of Sustainable Development working group of CCA</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">ProDoc signing and inception period/workshop implemented. Appropriate management structures (PMU and PMB) established. 
Two progress reports successfully submitted and approved by GCF, and second tranche approved by GCF in December 2021. 
Initial hiring of consultants implemented. 
- vulnerability assessment for 4 priority sectors company produced inception report and analysis. 
- capacity assessment for relevant institutions ongoing in December of 2021. 
- support to the National Council of Sustainable Development working group of CCA provided with resulting relaunch of the NCSD as part of the General secretariat of the Government of Montenegro, which is an improvement compared to position within directorate in the Ministry as it was until project intervention in period September &#x2013; December 2021.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
